<h2>Templates</h2>

<p>
    Templates are the email content for your campaigns. They live in the Template Library and can be reused across multiple campaigns.
</p>

<p>
    <strong>Template features:</strong>
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>HTML body</strong> – Rich, formatted email content with images and styling</li>
    <li><strong>Plain text version</strong> – A text-only fallback for email clients that don't support HTML</li>
    <li><strong>Subject line</strong> – The email subject (can include variables that get filled in)</li>
    <li><strong>Merge fields</strong> – Placeholders like {ClientName} that get replaced with actual data</li>
    <li><strong>Headers and footers</strong> – Consistent branding that appears on all emails</li>
</ul>

<p>
    You can edit templates in the Library, and changes will affect future campaigns that use that template (but not campaigns that have already been sent).
</p>

