<h2>The Library</h2>

<p>
    The Library is where you manage templates and segments. It's organized into sections:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Templates</strong> – All your email templates</li>
    <li><strong>Segments</strong> – All your recipient segments</li>
</ul>

<p>
    From the Library, you can:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Create new templates or segments</li>
    <li>Edit existing ones</li>
    <li>Preview how they'll look</li>
    <li>See which campaigns use each template or segment</li>
    <li>Test templates with sample data</li>
</ul>

<p>
    The Library makes it easy to refine your email content and recipient lists without leaving the Outreach Center.
</p>

