<h2>Creating a Campaign</h2>

<p>
    Here's the typical flow for creating a campaign:
</p>

<ol>
    <li><strong>Choose or create a template</strong> – Select an existing template from the Library or create a new one</li>
    <li><strong>Choose or create a segment</strong> – Select who should receive the email</li>
    <li><strong>Set the schedule</strong> – Decide when to send (immediately or scheduled for later)</li>
    <li><strong>Configure settings</strong> – Set send limits, approval requirements, and other options</li>
    <li><strong>Review and approve</strong> – Preview the campaign and approve it for sending</li>
    <li><strong>Monitor progress</strong> – Watch as emails are sent and track delivery</li>
</ol>

<p>
    The Outreach Center guides you through each step and shows you exactly what will happen before you send.
</p>

