<h2>Provider Diagnostics</h2>

<p>
    Before sending a large campaign, it's wise to check Provider Diagnostics. This shows you:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>DNS status</strong> – Whether your email domain is properly configured</li>
    <li><strong>Throttling status</strong> – Current rate limits and sending capacity</li>
    <li><strong>Adapter health</strong> – Whether the email delivery system is working correctly</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Running diagnostics before a big send helps you avoid surprises and ensures your emails will be delivered successfully.
</p>

