<h2>Change Requests</h2>

<p>
    Sometimes plans change and you need to modify a campaign that's already scheduled or running. Change Requests let you:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Pause a campaign</strong> – Stop sending if something comes up</li>
    <li><strong>Change the status</strong> – Move a campaign between Draft, Scheduled, and other statuses</li>
    <li><strong>Update settings</strong> – Modify send limits or other configuration</li>
    <li><strong>Cancel a campaign</strong> – Stop it completely if needed</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Change Requests help you stay in control and adapt when circumstances change.
</p>

