<h2>Safety Features</h2>

<p>
    The Outreach Center includes several safety features to prevent mistakes:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Approval requirements</strong> – Campaigns can require approval before sending</li>
    <li><strong>Safety seed addresses</strong> – Test emails sent to specific addresses before the full campaign</li>
    <li><strong>Send limits</strong> – Daily, hourly, and total limits to prevent accidental mass sends</li>
    <li><strong>Deduplication</strong> – Prevents sending the same email to the same person multiple times</li>
</ul>

<p>
    These features help ensure campaigns are sent correctly and safely.
</p>

