<h2>Tips for Successful Campaigns</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Test with safety seeds first</strong> – Always send test emails to yourself or a small group before the full campaign</li>
    <li><strong>Check diagnostics regularly</strong> – Make sure your email infrastructure is healthy</li>
    <li><strong>Use segments wisely</strong> – Target the right audience for better results</li>
    <li><strong>Preview templates</strong> – See how emails will look before sending</li>
    <li><strong>Monitor during sending</strong> – Watch for issues and be ready to pause if needed</li>
    <li><strong>Review metrics after</strong> – Learn from delivery rates and engagement</li>
</ul>

